    <author>Domestique Library</author>
    <name>Threshold (33min)</name>
    <description>Warmup: 10min ramp from 50% to 75% FTP | Steady: 2min 10s @ 50% FTP | Steady: 10s @ 105% FTP | Steady: 10s @ 40% FTP | Steady: 20s @ 105% FTP | Steady: 20s @ 40% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 105% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 40% FTP | Steady: 40s @ 105% FTP | Steady: 40s @ 40% FTP | Steady: 50s @ 105% FTP | Steady: 50s @ 40% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 105% FTP | Steady: 5min @ 40% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 105% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 40% FTP | Steady: 50s @ 105% FTP | Steady: 50s @ 40% FTP | Steady: 40s @ 105% FTP | Steady: 40s @ 40% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 105% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 40% FTP | Steady: 20s @ 105% FTP | Steady: 20s @ 40% FTP | Steady: 10s @ 105% FTP | Cooldown: 5min from 60% to 35% FTP</description>
